<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: I make Poké Balls from Apricorns.\rCollect them from trees and bring\n’em to me.\rI’ll make Poké Balls out of them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: You have Apricorns for me?\fFine! I’ll turn them into Poké Balls.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: It’ll take a day to make you a\nPoké Ball. Come back for it later.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Oh...\nThat’s a letdown.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: I’m working!\nDon’t bother me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI just finished your Poké Ball. Here!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Your Bag is full!\nCome back when it’s lighter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: That turned out great.\rTry catching Pokémon with it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can’t find Bubbles. She always\nwaits by our step for breakfast.\fShe didn’t come.\rIf you see a SLOWPOKE with a chip\nin her tail, that’s Bubbles, okay?\fTell her I’m waiting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grandpa’s gone...\nI’m so lonely...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found her! You found Bubbles!\rSee? She’s yawning again. That\nmeans she’s REALLY okay.\rThank you, thank you, THANK you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dad works at Silph where he studies\nPoké Balls.\rI have to stay home with Grandpa\nand SLOWPOKE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right!\nI’ll give you my grandpa’s number. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Kurt\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My grandpa can tell you more\nabout Apricorns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No? Why?\nYou don’t want to talk to my grandpa?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You want to talk to my grandpa,\ndon’t you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUBBLES: ...\n...Yaaawn!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You see three people, with landscape\nin the background.\rIt’s Kurt, Professor Oak, and...\nin the middle,\fa lady with determined eyes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a statue of the forest’s\nprotector.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The radio is on.\rIt’s Professor Oak’s Pokémon Talk!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The radio is on.\rA Goldenrod interviewer is asking\nwho chartered last week’s freight\fcars. The host laughs it off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: You’re not from here. Good.\nMeans you can see it plain--\feveryone born in this town’s gone\nhalf deaf to that well, and now\fit’s screaming and they’re\narguing about PERMITS.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: I’d go down myself. These\nknees say otherwise. These lungs\fsay otherwise, loud as that\nmachine-hum.\rI made balls for this town for\nsixty years so its Pokémon could\fcome home safe. And I can’t walk\ndown my own well to bring them\fhome.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: Turk’s at the well mouth.\nMy grandson. He’s got the heart\ffor it and none of the nerve--he\nwon’t go down alone, and he’s\fright not to.\rBut two of you? Go on. Find out\nwhat they’re doing to my SLOWPOKE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: You brought them back.\rSome of them... aren’t right.\nBut you brought them back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: Sixty years of balls out of\nthis workshop. Here’s a different\fsort of stone--the honest kind of\nKing’s Rock.\rThe kind that helps a Pokémon\nbecome itself when IT chooses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: Bring me Apricorns whenever\nyou like. The work’s good for my\fhands, and the balls are good for\nthis town.</language>
	</row>
</body>
